Did you know that this is for everyone?

1014
01:56:51.098 --> 01:56:54.098
It is for married people, it is for unmarried people.

1015
01:56:54.098 --> 01:56:57.098
It is for young couples who are still dating.

1016
01:56:57.098 --> 01:56:58.098
It is for children.

1017
01:56:58.098 --> 01:57:01.098
The family, everyone comes from a family.

1018
01:57:01.098 --> 01:57:04.098
So the topic of the family is for everyone.

1019
01:57:04.098 --> 01:57:08.098
But we all need Jesus, because without Jesus, we cannot make this work.

1020
01:57:08.098 --> 01:57:11.098
And I want to end this service with the following prayer.

1021
01:57:11.098 --> 01:57:14.098
Maybe we can display the prayer on the screen.

1022
01:57:14.098 --> 01:57:16.098
And I just want to pray.

1023
01:57:16.098 --> 01:57:18.098
Thank you, Jesus.

1024
01:57:18.098 --> 01:57:21.098
I believe that you are the Son of God.

1025
01:57:21.098 --> 01:57:25.098
I believe that you died on the cross for my sin.

1026
01:57:25.098 --> 01:57:31.098
Forgive us our mistakes that we make regarding relationships.

1027
01:57:31.098 --> 01:57:35.098
Forgive us, Lord, when we put ourselves at the center.

1028
01:57:35.098 --> 01:57:38.098
Instead of the people you have placed next to us.

1029
01:57:38.098 --> 01:57:40.098
Forgive us our mistakes.

1030
01:57:40.098 --> 01:57:43.098
We invite you into our lives, Jesus.

1031
01:57:43.098 --> 01:57:46.098
Give us a new way of living.

1032
01:57:46.098 --> 01:57:48.098
A new start.

1033
01:57:48.098 --> 01:57:50.098
Help us to live for you.

1034
01:57:50.098 --> 01:57:53.098
Help us, Lord, for we cannot do it ourselves.

1035
01:57:53.098 --> 01:57:57.098
From today on, I know that I am a child of God.

1036
01:57:57.098 --> 01:58:00.098
And that we can live as He wants.

1037
01:58:00.098 --> 01:58:02.098
And not as we want.

1038
01:58:02.098 --> 01:58:04.098
We trust in you, Jesus.

1039
01:58:04.098 --> 01:58:06.098
And I declare in our families, in the name of Jesus.

1040
01:58:06.098 --> 01:58:08.098
Maybe you can pray this.

1041
01:58:08.098 --> 01:58:12.098
As a blessing for families and a blessing over measures.

1042
01:58:12.098 --> 01:58:19.098
Father, we pray for your blessing over every family.

1043
01:58:19.098 --> 01:58:33.098
Thank you that your Word shows that when Jesus is our goal, a blessing comes from that.

1044
01:58:33.098 --> 01:58:41.098
Father, we pray today for a renewal of feeling.

1045
01:58:41.098 --> 01:58:43.098
For men and women in the story.

1046
01:58:43.098 --> 01:58:46.098
A renewal of feeling where a renewal is needed.

1047
01:58:46.098 --> 01:58:48.098
So Lord, I pray for the marriages today.

1048
01:58:48.098 --> 01:58:51.098
And where a renewal of thinking is needed.

1049
01:58:51.098 --> 01:58:53.098
Lord, I pray that you will provide that.

1050
01:58:53.098 --> 01:58:59.098
And Holy Spirit, thank you that you help men to lead as Christ leads and cares for his church.

1051
01:58:59.098 --> 01:59:02.098
Give them courage, give them strength.

1052
01:59:02.098 --> 01:59:05.098
To lead their families well.

1053
01:59:05.098 --> 01:59:08.098
To protect.

1054
01:59:08.098 --> 01:59:11.098
To set boundaries.

1055
01:59:11.098 --> 01:59:14.098
To be self-sacrificial.

1056
01:59:14.098 --> 01:59:17.098
To lay down their lives for their wives and children.

1057
01:59:17.098 --> 01:59:20.098
To protect their lives.

1058
01:59:20.098 --> 01:59:23.098
To protect their lives.

1059
01:59:23.098 --> 01:59:26.098
To protect their lives.

1060
01:59:26.098 --> 01:59:28.098
To protect their lives.

1061
01:59:29.098 --> 01:59:32.098
For there your glory will rest.

1062
01:59:34.098 --> 01:59:37.098
And I pray for women,

1063
01:59:37.098 --> 01:59:40.098
to be filled with the Holy Spirit.

1064
01:59:40.098 --> 01:59:43.098
To see their role.

1065
01:59:44.098 --> 01:59:52.098
To see that it is our honor to honor our men.

1066
01:59:52.098 --> 01:59:57.098
And to care for our children.

1067
01:59:57.098 --> 02:00:02.098
And to raise them in the way of the Lord.

1068
02:00:02.098 --> 02:00:14.098
And we have a role to play in creating that atmosphere of faith and gratitude.

1069
02:00:14.098 --> 02:00:17.098
Of worship and prayer.

1070
02:00:17.098 --> 02:00:37.098
So I pray for women that they will take on that role to change the atmosphere in the home and to bend towards an atmosphere of prayer and worship.

1071
02:00:37.098 --> 02:00:42.098
And of gratitude, of being thankful.

1072
02:00:42.098 --> 02:00:44.098
Amen.

1073
02:00:45.098 --> 02:00:47.098
We bless our families.

1074
02:00:47.098 --> 02:00:49.098
Thank you for watching.

1075
02:00:49.098 --> 02:00:53.098
We will see you this coming Wednesday during the Midweek Update.

1076
02:00:53.098 --> 02:00:57.098
And next week is already the last week of Open Relationships.

1077
02:00:57.098 --> 02:01:00.098
But engage with this matter.

1078
02:01:00.098 --> 02:01:04.098
It is worth nothing if you only look at it and say that was a nice sermon.

1079
02:01:04.098 --> 02:01:06.098
Or that is different.

1080
02:01:06.098 --> 02:01:10.098
You really have to engage with this because otherwise it will not take effect in your life.

1081
02:01:10.098 --> 02:01:12.098
We'll see you Wednesday.

1082
02:01:12.098 --> 02:01:13.098
Bye bye.

1083
02:01:13.098 --> 02:01:15.098
Be blessed.
